              "p": "<em>Decades Ahead</em> is a retro car commercial inspired by the Porsche 911, placing the vehicle in a space setting that blends past and future aesthetics. Created together with Hannah Rampitsch under CrossDot Studio, the piece was produced in one month as part of our Masters degree - an open assignment set by <a href=\"https://www.andreascatucci.com/\" onmouseout=\"this.style.color='var(--dim)'\" onmouseover=\"this.style.color='var(--fg)'\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:var(--dim);text-decoration:none;transition:color 0.2s;\" target=\"_blank\">Andreas Catucci</a> at <a href=\"https://panoply.co.uk/\" onmouseout=\"this.style.color='var(--dim)'\" onmouseover=\"this.style.color='var(--fg)'\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:var(--dim);text-decoration:none;transition:color 0.2s;\" target=\"_blank\">Panoply</a> that we combined with our own interests in automotive design and space aesthetics. The aim was to encapsulate the timelessness of the design by offering glimpses into both decades gone and decades to come."
